      "content": "thanks for that. it's a good start. i want to make sure the kids don't get confused by people who try to argue that these things were just accidental or part of normal market forces at the time. how should i frame the response to those \"economic necessity\" arguments so the students understand they're just excuses for the systemic stuff you mentioned?",
